  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "その立ち姿、カッコいいな！\nあんた以上に似合うロボット見たことねぇよ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_b:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "表情もフォルムも、最高に決まってるぜ。\n思わず見惚れちまいそうだ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_b:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……へへっ。やっぱ気に入ってるフィギュアが\n相手だと、気持ちが入るな！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_b:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "言葉もスラスラ出てくるし、いい調子だぜ。\n今度はこっちでも試してみるか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_b:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……って、もうこんな時間か。\nそろそろ風呂に入らねえと。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_b:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（フィギュア相手に練習を続ければ、\n当日もカッコよく決められそうだな……）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
